    "body": "fix on issue/3186-xtask-directory-suites · PR #3707 · pinned by directory_tests::selection::an_asset_named_in_a_child_module_selects_its_directory_suite, directory_tests::selection::a_catalog_change_selects_a_directory_example_catalog, directory_tests::selection::a_directory_suite_without_ignored_tests_gets_no_heavy_step, heavy_tests::a_directory_suite_gets_a_heavy_step_only_when_a_module_holds_an_ignore · merges when reviewed\n\nThe PR does `assets.rs`, `catalog.rs` and `plan::may_run_ignored`. It says `Refs #3186`. The `quick.rs` part (the `<submod>::` filter) is in #3706. When PR #3707 merges, no work of this issue stays outside #3706.\n",
